{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26642","headline":"九日寄钱可复 · 姚合","name":"九日寄钱可复","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数盃黄菊酒，千里白云天。\n上国名方振，戎州病未痊。\n静愁惟忆醉，闲走不胜眠。\n惆怅东门别，相逢知几年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}